  "caption": "Typing ki mehnat bachao: ChatGPT voice typing ab sabke liye, free plan pe bhi.\nChatGPT Live Dictation mein tum bolte jao, text saath-saath likha jaata hai. 10 minute wali limit bhi hat gayi.\n\nKaise:\n1. ChatGPT app update karo ya website kholo\n2. Message box mein mic icon pe tap karo\n3. Bolo, phir bhejne se pehle text theek kar lo\n\nAsli use: lamba prompt bolke do. Resume ki saari detail, email ka poora mamla. Zyada detail = better jawab.\nTrick: bolte waqt waveform pe tap karo, text chhup jaayega. Dobara tap karo, poora text dikhega.\n\nSach bhi: AI galat sun sakta hai, bhejne se pehle padho. Audio chat history ke saath save rehta hai, chat delete karne par aam taur pe 30 din mein hat jaata hai. Password ya bank detail kabhi mat bolo. Rollout chal raha hai, mic na dikhe to app update karte raho.\n\nComment mein BOLO likho, sabko reply karunga.\n\n#aitools #chatgpthindi #aitoolsforfree #chatgpt #aihindi"
